<title>MEXICO: U.S.-Mexico livestock movements update - USDA.</title>
<headline>U.S.-Mexico livestock movements update - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Weekly livestock movements between Mexico and the United States, to Nov 9 - USDA</p>
<p>(Livestock per head, year in Jan/Dec calendar year)</p>
<p>Mexican exports</p>
<p>    Type			   Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Feeders		    16,379	 247,465   1,293,346</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0	     816	71,215</p>
<p>Texas exports to Mexico</p>
<p>	Beef			 Week	    Year    Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter		   2,738	  98,130	   543</p>
<p>    Breeding males		 45	   1,354	   746</p>
<p>    Breeding females	     50	   1,594	 1,740</p>
<p>	Hogs			 Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Slaughter			 0	    31,842	 432</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  4		 352	 506</p>
<p>    Breeding females		3	     2,739     2,705</p>
<p>	Dairy			Week	     Year   Year Ago</p>
<p>    Breeding males		  0		 59	  126</p>
<p>    Breeding females	    345	    10,987     6,327</p>
<p>  New Mexico export figures to Mexico were unavailable for the week.</p>
<p>--Timna Tanners, Mexico City newsroom +525 728-7903.</p>
